# The build context of the container-per-function image. 'COPY . /var/task' bakes the function's
# own files (the handler and any script, data file or folder beside it) into the image; these are
# scaffolding, source control and build output, not function payload. The runtime files the
# Dockerfile copies into /var/runtime (bootstrap, runtime.ps1, PowerShellLambdaContext.cs and
# modules/) must stay in the context, so they are not listed here.
.dockerignore
Dockerfile
README.md
lambdaps-runtime.json
**/.git
**/.gitignore
**/*.zip
